id: TEST-024
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Cypress hard wait with milliseconds
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .cy.ts .cy.js .spec.ts .spec.js
  exclude_paths: .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: cy.
patterns:
  - regex: cy\.wait\(\d{4,}\)
    message: "cy.wait with milliseconds — use cy.intercept() aliases instead of hard timeouts"
fix: Use cy.intercept() to create route aliases and cy.wait('@alias') for deterministic waiting. Hard waits cause flaky tests.
